#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:2
#: c4332266e3f842cc912424ee842fcfe0
msgid "The TCP Server APIs"
msgstr "TCP サーバー API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:5
#: 769ff5b424d54086a70b199663089327
msgid "TCP Server setup API"
msgstr "TCPサーバーセットアップAPI"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:7
#: 2d81aa6d8ba84a868113fd9e08fc5c60
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is used to create a TCP server. The server in "
"the protocol is usually used to connect and listen to the TCP clients and"
" handle the data from the clients."
msgstr ""
"TCP サーバー セットアップ API は、TCP サーバーを作成するために使用されます。プロトコル内のサーバーは通常、TCP "
"クライアントに接続してリッスンし、クライアントからのデータを処理するために使用されます。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:39
#: ddc5d0f6bc1b4162af2bb49f6b25a031
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is defined in the ``TCP_Server_Base`` class. The"
" parameters of the ``__init__`` method are as follows:"
msgstr ""
"TCP サーバー設定 API は ``TCP_Server_Base`` クラスで定義されます。 ``__init__`` "
"メソッドのパラメータは次のとおりです。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:42
#: f1ffcdd5c8e74b9cbdb5e5fc8eeb34ce
msgid "``host``: The host IP address to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``host``: TCP サーバーをバインドするホストの IP アドレス。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:43
#: 7e419c2e704a44228bd0bdeed976d861
msgid "``port``: The port number to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``port``: TCP サーバーをバインドするポート番号。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:44
#: 854e298d71f140069b6ed51806224ca5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_clients``: The maximum number of concurrent clients the server can "
"handle (ignored when ``is_asynic_clients_io`` is ``True``)."
msgstr "``max_clients``: サーバーが処理できる同時クライアントの最大数。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:46
#: 203462f6b127478cb9bb0c2093362827
msgid "``port_add_step``: The step size for incrementing the port number."
msgstr "``port_add_step``: ポート番号をインクリメントするステップ サイズ。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:47
#: 3d0355b5c1924055a7d8b6acb907fad0
msgid "``port_range_num``: The number of ports to check in the range."
msgstr "``port_range_num``: 範囲内でチェックするポートの数。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:48
#: a7852ea136454a1298541e96cdece1bc
msgid ""
"``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: The maximum number of threads for file "
"transfer operations."
msgstr "``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: ファイル転送操作の最大スレッド数。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:49
#: 0f1b0f03ffe2472cb58725dc446f6f7c
msgid ""
"``is_hand_alloc_port``: A flag indicating whether to manually allocate "
"the port."
msgstr "``is_hand_alloc_port``: ポートを手動で割り当てるかどうかを示すフラグ。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:50
#: 969ca405744f4d57a8e70db30eada3f7
msgid ""
"``is_input_command_in_console``: A flag indicating whether to input "
"commands in the console."
msgstr "``is_input_command_in_console``: コンソールにコマンドを入力するかどうかを示すフラグ。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:51
#: 6b01091b3f124b8d87c9423eb6998be4
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: The maximum number of custom worker threads."
msgstr "``max_custom_workers``: カスタム ワーカー スレッドの最大数。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:52
#: c9d16d29465a48779ee2a54e4b9cc66e
msgid ""
"``is_extend_command``: A flag for extension protocols. With ``False`` "
"(the default) the constructor starts the server itself by calling "
"``start_TCP_Server()``; with ``True`` it does not, so an extension can "
"register its commands first and start the server later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:56
#: be13e03bfce24a5ca6e5733943a7db33
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: A flag indicating whether the messages exchanged "
"with clients are RSA-encrypted (see :ref:`tcp-server-encrypted-channel-"
"api`)."
msgstr ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: クライアントと交換されるメッセージが RSA 暗号化されているかどうかを示すフラグ (:ref"
":`tcp-server-encrypted-channel-api` を参照)。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:58
#: 3558d7e8c52442818701d4eb794b3643
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: An optional ``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` pair of "
"user-supplied RSA keys. Both files must exist, parse as PEM, and pair "
"with each other; an invalid pair is silently ignored and the default key "
"lookup is used instead (``None`` keeps the default lookup)."
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``: ユーザーが指定した RSA キーのオプションの ``[pub_key_path, "
"pvt_key_path]`` ペア。両方のファイルが存在し、PEM "
"として解析され、相互にペアになっている必要があります。無効なペアは黙って無視され、代わりにデフォルトのキー検索が使用されます (``None`` "
"はデフォルトの検索を維持します)。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:62
#: 86265e57f3aa48e58e3fb5d9de0a9277
msgid ""
"``max_mem_buff``: The in-memory buffering ceiling of the forward pump, "
"given in MiB and stored as bytes (``self.max_mem_buff``); past it the "
"uploading peer is told to pause. The default is 2048."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:65
#: 7d4dd6bf4eff4f4db8ce0187088f172c
msgid ""
"``recv_messages_chunk_len``: The number of bytes read per receive on the "
"control connection, covering commands and messages. The default is 4096."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:67
#: 8fb93ff5bf2f49b18f2f42c92e66123f
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_chunk_len``: The chunk size in bytes for streaming a file"
" or folder transfer in either direction. The default is 65536 (64 KiB)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:69
#: f12bacde2a874840879a51af63eeefde
msgid ""
"``is_asynic_clients_io``: A flag indicating whether clients are served by"
" asyncio coroutines on one event loop instead of one thread per client. "
"It lifts the ``max_clients`` limit, so a single server can hold thousands"
" of concurrent connections."
msgstr ""
"'' is_asynic_clients_io "
"'':クライアントごとに1つのスレッドではなく、1つのイベントループでクライアントがasyncioコルーチンによって提供されるかどうかを示すフラグ。これにより、''"
" max_clients ''の制限が解除されるため、1台のサーバーで数千の同時接続を保持できます。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:73
#: 3a36a9bba6004a41b358be9975788707
msgid ""
"``is_debug``: A flag selecting how much detail is logged. With ``False`` "
"(the default) the server logs command content and execution results only;"
" with ``True`` it also logs the key steps of the execution process."
msgstr ""
"'' is_debug '':記録される詳細の量を選択するフラグ。'' False "
"''（デフォルト）を使用すると、サーバーはコマンドの内容と実行結果のみをログに記録します。'' True "
"''を使用すると、実行プロセスの主要なステップもログに記録します。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:76
#: be13e03bfce24a5ca6e5733943a7db33
msgid ""
"``is_print_log``: A flag indicating whether the server logs at all. With "
"``False`` it prints nothing, whatever ``is_debug`` says."
msgstr ""
"'' is_print_log '':サーバーがまったくログを記録しているかどうかを示すフラグ。'' False ''では、'' is_debug"
" ''が何であれ、何も出力しません。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:79
#: 2994b78415964ff0adc713a4daed1b6b
msgid ""
"``is_enable_file_transfer_progress_bar``: A flag indicating whether every"
" running file transfer is tracked in ``file_recv_progress`` (downloads) "
"and ``file_upload_progress`` (uploads). Each entry is a ``[transferred "
"bytes, total bytes, current speed, local file path, peer]`` list keyed by"
" the transfer's fid — ``peer`` is the ``(ip, port)`` of the transfer's "
"original sender (downloads) or receiver (uploads), never the relay of a "
"forwarded transfer. The entry is removed once the transfer ends; an "
"interrupted one keeps its entry (and its partial file) so the reconnect "
"logic can resume it. ``file_trans_progress_file`` names the file under "
"the protocol's ``.Flow`` directory these stores are written to when a "
"connection drops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:90
#: 9f9de22b50a94553ac1113f290dff1b4
msgid ""
"``is_enable_real_time_network_speed``: A flag indicating whether the "
"protocol's real-time network speed is measured. With ``True`` (the "
"default) every send and receive — the control layer and every temporary "
"connection, file transfers included — feeds ``upload_network_speed`` and "
"``recv_network_speed`` (bytes per second, a rolling average over "
"``NETWORK_SPEED_WINDOW`` seconds). With ``False`` nothing is measured and"
" every speed value is ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:98
#: 8b0a1bb7ed944884854a936968f3b4bd
